    "explanation": "Raynor excels if played with Heroes that can easily protect him, while also creating space so he can deliver more Basic Attacks. Beside the tanks with decent peel capabilities, Thrall is a good teammate, since Earthquake's slow will not only assist Raynor against engages, but will also allow him to play freely in fights."
