      "name": "Penetrating Round Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "The Penetrating Round Build is designed to amplify Raynor's damage while also giving him good survivability. At level 1, Exterminator will drastically increase Raynor's PvE damage. It should be picked in Maps where waveclear and mercenaries are essential, or in Battlefield of Eternity, to greatly increase damage on immortal. At Level 10, both Heroic Abilities are viable, however, we recommend Raynor's Raider as the main option, while Hyperion can be a great option to push Forts, Keeps or to control Objectives in Volskaya Foundry or Infernal Shrines.",
